title: "GPU Placement Explorer"
abstract: "An open source utility that compares cost, carbon, and commitment breakevens for GPU workloads across public cloud, GPU specialist cloud, colocation, and owned hardware options. Default rates are illustrations; replace them with current quotes before treating any comparison as real."
